&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience applying data science, machine learning and statistical modelling techniques to analyse complex datasets and generate actionable insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
